      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 680,
        "height": 2180,
        "content": "# 🎬 AI Devotional Reels Factory\nTelegram → NanoBanana → VEO3 → Blotato\n\nSend a deity/scene photo + caption idea to your Telegram bot. The workflow builds a cinematic devotional reel (9:16) and posts it to Instagram, YouTube Shorts, TikTok, Facebook and X automatically.\n\n---\n\n# ⚙️ Requirements\n\n1. Telegram bot token (via @BotFather)\n2. OpenAI API key (vision + script + caption)\n3. kie.ai API key (VEO3 video generation)\n4. fal.ai API key (NanoBanana image edit)\n5. Blotato account + API key, social accounts connected\n6. Google account (Drive + Sheets) — duplicate the tracker sheet\n7. n8n: enable Verified Community Nodes, install the Blotato node\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
